---
import Terminal from '@fce/shared/components/Terminal.astro';
---

<section id="dogfood" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-center">Mission Control builds Mission Control.</h2>
    <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] text-center mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed">
      This isn't a pitch deck. Every feature exists because we needed it. Here's what a real workflow looks like.
    </p>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mt-12">
      <!-- Terminal -->
      <div>
        <Terminal
          title="Mission Control Dashboard"
          lines={[
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">mc-landing / workflow #347</span>',
            '',
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">Task:</span>     Add rate limiting to API endpoints',
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">Risk:</span>     <span class="text-[var(--color-warning)]">MEDIUM</span> → routed to Sonnet 4',
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">Status:</span>   <span class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">██████████████</span><span class="text-[var(--border)]">░░░░░░</span>  70%',
            '',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Task spec generated                    <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">00:03</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Agent assigned (Sonnet 4)              <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">00:04</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Implementation complete                <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">04:12</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Lint gate passed                       <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">04:18</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Security scan passed                   <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">04:31</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--color-success)]">✓</span> Test coverage gate passed (94%)        <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">05:02</span>',
            '<span class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">→</span> Architectural review in progress...    <span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">05:15</span>',
            '',
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">Evidence bundle:</span> 12 artifacts collected',
            '<span class="text-[var(--text-muted)]">PR #891</span> ready for human review',
          ]}
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Explanation -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 justify-center">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Intelligent model routing</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Opus for architecture decisions. Sonnet for feature work. Haiku for mechanical refactors. Stop burning money running your smartest model on boilerplate.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Policy gates, not vibes</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every PR passes linting, security scanning, test coverage, and architectural review before a human ever sees it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)]">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Evidence bundles</h3>
          <p class="text-[var(--text-secondary)] mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Every PR ships with a full audit trail — task spec, agent reasoning, policy checks passed, review decisions. Your compliance team will send you a thank-you note.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
